/-!
Finite permutation certificates for the native J₂ Borel.  The tables retain the
ATLAS degree-100 carrier (the pair and its normalizer are the concrete model
used in DGS, §10.9, pp. 162–163).  They record the Borel and its one-step
extension, together with conjugators for the two finite orbit calculations.
The later files use these tables only through the checked equalities below.
-/
@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.LeechRelated.J2.ExceptionalParabolics.SecondParabolic.BorelAutomorphisms
